{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "f9587769ca7c5381105e2529737af108ee8390e9c4cf2c28d9588783ba22a012", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　開始前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8000_place", "source_sha256": "3706620375d1320dd5983a9463ada5b3d2544c7c06d97e3274c0ba88d2d2c2de", "ja": "浜辺", "zh": "海边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8001_p", "source_sha256": "895a1fc6f4455df548e55fbfd5b6ea7d68fedc493fb5250bebfcba62289bcf82", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\n杏奈は『元気をくれる舞姫』をテーマに撮影に挑む）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，\n杏奈以“带来活力的舞姬”为主题进行拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8002_024ann", "source_sha256": "9886581e1c1f3323ebd69c26de17d2331f864c65c68d2875ebfea3bf3e1fb819", "ja": "杏奈が舞姫にビビッと変身！　この水着、\nとってもかわいいから、みんな喜んでくれるかも♪", "zh": "杏奈一眨眼就变身成舞姬！这件泳装超级可爱，大家说不定都会喜欢呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8003_024ann", "source_sha256": "09cf1458287434675eb0bb842472ced761250b3bd67839f17aae466ee1447b57", "ja": "ファンのみんなも、{$P$}さんも、\n杏奈がいっぱい元気にしてあげるね！", "zh": "粉丝们，还有{$P$}先生，杏奈都会让你们充满活力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8004_p", "source_sha256": "1622211a7ca2ad86de12ccb92a6b698e1cfd04a2c92fcf8ef0c13703a17c6da7", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。杏奈の気持ちが、\nグラビアを見た人たちに届くように頑張ろう。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。一起努力，让看了写真的人们感受到杏奈的心意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8005_024ann", "source_sha256": "9ae1f96104bf94ffd6f751adf2e4ea52b2d230dadd7e7ab22593b094a456facc", "ja": "あ、ねえねえ。ゲームだと、舞姫の踊りは、仲間を\n元気にしたり、いろんなバフをかけてくれるけど……。", "zh": "啊，对了。游戏里，舞姬的舞蹈能让同伴打起精神，还能施加各种增益效果，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8006_024ann", "source_sha256": "85e23798e58c460215924b3b0ae80e1dba9b8a59ecf46f4d618d51f27599ef6e", "ja": "{$P$}さんならどんなバフが欲しい？\nそれに合わせてポーズとか考えてみるね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生想要什么样的增益？\n杏奈会配合那个来想动作的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8007_p", "source_sha256": "8ebf5053225abab94a8685895d0a831fdc0a8b0bdc85481ba29cba9573c6ae63", "ja": "バフ……つまり、強化のことだよな。\nそうだな、それなら……。", "zh": "增益……也就是强化，对吧。\n这么说的话，那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8008", "source_sha256": "5d93d886c1eb5a0b156e56f2c43b2d1a54b6842fb5d715d2c20f5fc3bd09c3e6", "ja": "体力が欲しい", "zh": "想要体力", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8009", "source_sha256": "a5509d22ddd59231da4b237464f12b4e8af6a7613b2f3840bd08360fa50b8c2b", "ja": "気力をアップしたい", "zh": "想提升干劲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8010", "source_sha256": "4d956ab67ebce579238f67c0365e50a2ee29db4b121e54c5e3442f851e6518ea", "ja": "笑いが……", "zh": "笑声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8100_p", "source_sha256": "a893096a4d8681debbd3e7437a32c681104347778811bdd5459987aef9b70594", "ja": "体力が欲しいかもな。この撮影もその後も、\n最後までいい状態で走り抜けたいから。", "zh": "我可能需要点体力啊。因为不管是这次拍摄，还是之后，都想保持良好状态坚持到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8101_024ann", "source_sha256": "81b5ba2c1b99da31d45f18cfd0cdf006614320932585f92a85505c741f87b388", "ja": "うんうん、スタミナは大事だよね。\nそういうことなら杏奈に任せて！　いっくよ～！", "zh": "嗯嗯，体力的确很重要呢。\n要是这样的话就交给杏奈吧！要上咯～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8102_024ann", "source_sha256": "f8ba82ab4d080539b22cc237e526cfa3b09a25c685a83793315beb691634ba66", "ja": "{$P$}さんの笑顔と元気を\nビビッとフルチャージ♪　杏奈が応援してるよ♪", "zh": "把{$P$}先生的笑容和活力\n嗖地充满电♪杏奈在为你加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8200_p", "source_sha256": "fa1a31344d6b224ca1f874d6261f414e620bc1221de9f172d1ec2dff1db8e115", "ja": "気力アップのバフが助かるかもしれないな。\nたとえば、綺麗な舞いとかはやる気に繋がりそうだ。", "zh": "提升气力的增益效果或许会派上用场。\n比如，优美的舞姿似乎就能让人干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8201_024ann", "source_sha256": "185a50230b3da626bd8827c28d84794bd2fc42b9f678697ef6f1429f0e7a6652", "ja": "たしかに、綺麗な踊りを見るとなんだかワクワクして、\n「よーし、杏奈もやるぞー☆」って気持ちになるもん。", "zh": "确实，看了优美的舞蹈，就会莫名兴奋起来，\n产生“好——杏奈也要上啦☆”这样的想法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8202_024ann", "source_sha256": "393f1e57ea257ddd748de1d6bba4461a2ee887719b756bc02251d48de60bafa6", "ja": "必要なレベルは高そうだけど、挑戦してみるね！\n見ててね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "虽然需要的等级似乎很高，但我会试着挑战一下！\n看好了哦，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8300_p", "source_sha256": "d0eec7a344da86f77789eda9f6bc998c0f9b590b41bf8de1ced285ef5042b746", "ja": "そうだな。クスッと笑える要素があると、\n気分もあがっていいなと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊，要是能加入让人忍不住笑出来的元素，心情也会变好，我觉得这样挺不错的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8301_024ann", "source_sha256": "cff2ed872b4713a2efc81905e5c9d0ae912e0993d499032a868bfbe9a364db88", "ja": "ええ！？　えっと……どういう踊りがいいんだろう？\n面白い踊りとか？　でも思いつかない～……。", "zh": "诶诶！？那个……跳什么样的舞比较好呢？\n搞笑一点的舞？可是我想不到啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_8302_024ann", "source_sha256": "e3631ddc8d010e22196941de7b60792f491e650d33297eb1841ac6b942b24ac4", "ja": "うう、なんか杏奈、混乱してきちゃったかも……。\n{$P$}さん、どうしよう。", "zh": "呜呜，杏奈感觉有点混乱了……\n{$P$}先生，该怎么办呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
